; expect-error: E_INVALID_CHAR
; expect-at: malformed-float-literal.zyl:8:12
; `1.2.3` is not a number. It read as the Float 1.2, so `print` said
; 1.200000 as if the source had said so: a plausible wrong number, which
; is the one kind of bug a compiler must not have.
(defn main ()
  (begin
    (print 1.2.3)
    0))
